  "summaries": {
    "en": "Roll timing, FP management, build diversity, and boss phase transitions for a complete Dark Souls III playthrough including DLC.",
    "ja": "ロールタイミング、FP管理、ビルド多様性、DLCを含むダークソウルIII完全攻略のボスフェーズ移行解説。"
  },
  "category": "soulslike",
  "difficulty": "advanced",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551269901-5c3b16b12d30?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "Poise is weight-dependent—equipping enough armour to reach poise breakpoints (before hyper armour activates on heavy attacks) determines whether you can trade hits with large weapons. Use the poise calculator for your build's weapon class.",
      "Ashen Estus Flask allocation (FP restoration) should be proportional to spell or weapon art usage—pure melee builds need only 1–2 Ashen charges; sorcery builds need 6–8. Allocate at Andre at the Shrine before each new area.",
      "Weapon scaling letters (S/A/B/C/D/E) determine which stat provides the highest damage bonus—a Strength S-scaling weapon at 40 Str outperforms the same weapon at 60 Str due to soft-cap diminishing returns.",
      "Boss fog walls in DS3 are permanent once cleared—collect all items and complete all NPC events in an area before killing the boss, as some NPCs relocate or disappear post-boss.",
      "Estus efficiency depends on animation cancelling—roll-cancel the final Estus sip animation by rolling immediately after the drinking sound ends to return to action 0.5 seconds earlier than waiting for the animation to finish."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "打撃強度は重量依存。十分な防具を装備して打撃強度のブレークポイント（重攻撃でハイパーアーマーが有効になる前）に達することが大型武器とのトレードヒットを決定する。武器クラスのための打撃強度計算ツールを使用する。",
      "灰エスト瓶の割り当て（FP回復）は呪術や武器スキルの使用に比例すべき。純粋な近接ビルドは1〜2灰チャージで十分。ソーサリービルドは6〜8が必要。新しいエリアの前に篝火のアンドレで割り当てる。",
      "武器のスケーリングランク（S/A/B/C/D/E）はどのステータスが最高ダメージボーナスを提供するかを決定する。強さSスケーリング武器は、ソフトキャップの逓減効果のため60ではなく40強さで最高ダメージを出す。",
      "DS3のボスの霧はクリア後永続的。NPCのイベントをすべて完了し、ボスを倒す前にエリアのすべてのアイテムを収集する。ボス後にNPCが別の場所に移動するか消えることがある。",
      "エスト効率は動作キャンセルに依存する。飲み音が終わった直後にロールしてエストの最後の飲みアニメーションをロールキャンセルする。アニメーションの完了を待つより0.5秒早く動作に戻れる。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "High Wall of Lothric and First Boss",
        "body": "Iudex Gundyr (the first boss) tests roll timing rather than damage output—the key pattern is: watch for the second phase tail-slam and roll away from it rather than toward his body. His Phase 1 poke attacks have a 0.3-second delay window; roll at the point of maximum extension, not on wind-up. After defeating Iudex, prioritise finding the Farron Keep bonfire (via Undead Settlement → Road of Sacrifices) to unlock the Giant\"s Coal from the last giant—this allows weapon infusion."
      },
      {
        "title": "Starting Class and Build Foundation",
        "body": "Knight is the recommended starting class for all playthroughs: highest base endurance (100% efficient rolls with medium armour) and solid Strength/Dexterity split usable for any weapon type. The most beginner-friendly build: 40 Strength, 40 Dexterity, 30 Vigor—applicable to 90% of all weapons. Avoid investing in Intelligence or Faith before the 40/40 split unless committing to a dedicated caster build; hybrid builds in DS3 are less effective per stat investment than in DS1 and DS2."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Abyss Watchers and Pontiff Sulyvahn",
        "body": "Abyss Watchers (Farron) is the first major multi-target boss. Prioritise killing the red-eyed Watcher (the ally Watcher) before attacking the standard-eyed Watchers—the red-eyed version deals damage to other Watchers equally. For Pontiff Sulyvahn (Irithyll), his shadow clone appears at 60% HP and mirrors all attacks. The safest strategy against both: maintain close range at his left hip (your right) to track the clone's position on the same side and avoid the two-clone cross-slash."
      },
      {
        "title": "Covenant Item Farming for PvP",
        "body": "Blue Sentinel and Blade of the Darkmoon covenants require Proof of a Concord Kept from Silver Knights in Anor Londo—the best farming spot is the two Silver Knights at the Anor Londo bonfire with the Symbol of Avarice and Gold Serpent Ring equipped (105% item discovery). Farming 30 Proofs takes approximately 4–6 hours; use this time to level Vigor to 50 and Endurance to 40 for the PvP phase of the game."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Soul of Cinder and DLC Preparation",
        "body": "Soul of Cinder (final boss) combines all previously encountered boss move sets. Phase 2 mimics Gwyn's AI from Dark Souls 1—aggressive close-range trading with a fast weapon and consistent roll timing at the last frame handles both phases efficiently. For the DLC (Ashes of Ariandel, Ringed City), ensure you are at minimum SL 90 with a fully upgraded weapon (+10 standard or +5 twinkling) before entering either DLC; both DLCs are tuned for near-endgame character builds."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Panic-rolling multiple times in succession—rolling costs Stamina (12–18 per roll); chain-rolling from a hit into safety is fine but continuing to roll in retreat burns Stamina needed for counter-attack.",
      "Levelling Attunement (for spell slots) without committing to a caster build—Attunement provides no offensive bonus for melee builds; invest those points in Vigor or Endurance instead.",
      "Fighting in narrow corridors rather than open areas—DS3 hitboxes extend fully in narrow corridors; large weapons and bosses in corridors have significantly larger effective range than their visible models suggest.",
      "Using Estus during a long boss combo rather than after—boss combos in DS3 average 4–6 hits; drinking Estus mid-combo trades into the remaining hits. Wait for a complete pause in the boss's pattern.",
      "Killing the large tree NPC (Patches) before completing his quest—Patches sells a unique Cleric's Sacred Chime upgrade material only available from his shop; he also provides information about Siegward's questline that is missable."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "連続してパニックロールする。ロールはスタミナ（ロールごとに12〜18）を消費する。被弾から安全な場所へのチェーンロールは問題ないが、退却しながらロールし続けると反撃に必要なスタミナが燃え尽きる。",
      "キャスタービルドにコミットせずに集中力（呪術スロット用）をレベルアップする。集中力は近接ビルドに攻撃的なボーナスを提供しない。代わりにそのポイントを活力や持久力に投資する。",
      "開けた場所ではなく狭い廊下で戦う。DS3のヒットボックスは狭い廊下で完全に伸びる。狭い廊下の大型武器やボスは目に見えるモデルより有効射程がかなり長い。",
      "長いボスのコンボ中ではなくコンボ後にエストを飲む。DS3のボスのコンボは平均4〜6ヒット。コンボ中にエストを飲むと残りのヒットに巻き込まれる。ボスのパターンが完全に止まるのを待つ。",
      "クエストを完了する前に大木のNPC（パッチ）を殺す。パッチは彼のショップからのみ入手可能なユニークな聖職者の神聖鐘強化素材を販売する。彼はまた見逃しやすいジークワードのクエストラインについての情報を提供する。"
    ]
  },
